{"step_index":1077,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-13T05:19:31Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-13T14:19:31+09:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-13T14:19:31+09:00\nCreated At: 2026-11-13T14:19:31+09:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-13T14:19:31+09:00\nShowing lines 80-160 of 268\n80:     ld_path_str = \":\".join(all_libs)\n81:   